### Section Naming Examples
```markdown
## Section Name Guidelines

### Navigation Sections
- ✅ DO: "Practice", "Exams", "Progress", "Dashboard"
- ❌ DON'T: "User Area", "Content Management", "Administrative Functions"

### Feature Names
- ✅ DO: "Exam Mode", "Daily Challenge", "Progress Tracker"
- ❌ DON'T: "Feature 1", "Module A", "Section 3"

### Action Buttons
- ✅ DO: "Start Quiz", "View Progress", "Take Challenge"
- ❌ DON'T: "Click Here", "Submit", "Go"
```

## Content Writing Patterns

### Hero Section Copy
```markdown
## Hero Section Template

**Headline**: [Clear value proposition in 5-8 words]
**Subheadline**: [Supporting benefit or description in 10-15 words]
**CTA Button**: [Action verb + benefit]

### Example:
**Headline**: Master Physics & Calculus Through Interactive Games
**Subheadline**: Turn difficult STEM concepts into engaging challenges that improve your exam scores
**CTA**: Start Learning Free
```

### Feature Description Copy
```markdown
## Feature Description Template

**Title**: [Feature name - clear and benefit-focused]
**Description**: [What it does + why it matters in 1-2 sentences]

### Example:
**Title**: Adaptive Learning Engine
**Description**: Our AI-powered system adjusts difficulty based on your performance, ensuring you're always challenged but never overwhelmed. Master concepts at your own pace.
```

